Package: querencia-screenshot
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, grim
Recommends: slurp, wl-clipboard
Description: Querencia Desktop screenshot tool (alpha)
 Querencia Screenshot takes pictures of the whole screen, of a window or
 of a rectangle on Wayland compositors with the wlr screencopy protocol
 (grim, slurp), shows a preview and saves to the Pictures folder or
 copies to the clipboard (wl-clipboard).
 .
 In Querencia Desktop the Print key opens it, Alt+Print captures a window.
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
